<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 980 470" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc"><title id="title">ATL Manager command and ownership diagram</title><desc id="desc">Three swimlanes. The human manager reads briefs, sets priorities, overrides, and receives escalations. Mira coordinates the wake loop, assignments, unblocking, and the brief. Workers Pip, Rowan, Sage, and Beacon execute inside bounded contracts and return evidence.</desc><defs><style>text{font-family:system-ui,sans-serif;fill:#1a1826}.t{font-size:22px;font-weight:700}.l{font-size:14px;font-weight:650}.s{font-size:11px;fill:#5d5b72}.z{fill:#ffffff;stroke:#dedde6;stroke-dasharray:6 5}.n{stroke-width:1}.p{fill:#ffffff;stroke:#3565d6}.e{stroke:#c3b9f2;stroke-width:2;fill:none}</style><marker id="a" markerWidth="8" markerHeight="8" refX="7" refY="4" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0 8 4 0 8z" fill="#c3b9f2"/></marker></defs><text x="24" y="36" class="t">ATL Manager · how you manage the team</text><text x="24" y="58" class="s">You decide; Mira routes; workers execute inside contracts. Every lane talks through the runner, not side channels.</text><rect x="20" y="82" width="940" height="110" rx="14" class="z"/><text x="300" y="106" class="l">YOU — the manager (human)</text><g transform="translate(36 120)"><rect width="210" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">See the picture</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">wake · brief --save · show</text></g><g transform="translate(266 120)"><rect width="220" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">Priorities + decisions</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">priority · budget · policy</text></g><g transform="translate(506 120)"><rect width="220" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">Overrides</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">--actor manager: any transition</text></g><g transform="translate(746 120)"><rect width="198" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">Escalations land here</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">blocked · escalated queue</text></g><rect x="20" y="208" width="940" height="100" rx="14" class="z"/><text x="300" y="230" class="l">MIRA — coordinator / chief of staff</text><g transform="translate(36 240)"><rect width="220" height="48" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="21" class="l">Wake loop</text><text x="13" y="38" class="s">what should happen next</text></g><g transform="translate(276 240)"><rect width="220" height="48" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="21" class="l">Assign triaged work</text><text x="13" y="38" class="s">worker + attempt budget</text></g><g transform="translate(516 240)"><rect width="220" height="48" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="21" class="l">Unblock / re-route</text><text x="13" y="38" class="s">blocked → triaged</text></g><g transform="translate(756 240)"><rect width="188" height="48" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="21" class="l">Manager brief</text><text x="13" y="38" class="s">shipped · blocked · evidence</text></g><rect x="20" y="324" width="940" height="110" rx="14" class="z"/><text x="300" y="348" class="l">WORKERS — bounded contracts, enforced by the runner</text><g transform="translate(36 356)"><rect width="220" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">Pip — triage</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">objective + observable checks</text></g><g transform="translate(276 356)"><rect width="220" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">Rowan — build</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">workspace only · evidence</text></g><g transform="translate(516 356)"><rect width="220" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">Sage — review</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">diff + evidence · independent</text></g><g transform="translate(756 356)"><rect width="188" height="54" rx="10" class="n p"/><text x="13" y="23" class="l">Beacon — verify</text><text x="13" y="42" class="s">finish checks · night watch</text></g><path d="M141 174v66" class="e" marker-end="url(#a)"/><text x="150" y="206" class="s">priorities · decisions</text><path d="M850 240v-66" class="e" marker-end="url(#a)"/><text x="640" y="200" class="s">brief · escalations · evidence</text><path d="M146 288v68" class="e" marker-end="url(#a)"/><text x="156" y="326" class="s">assignments + contracts</text><path d="M850 356v-68" class="e" marker-end="url(#a)"/><text x="620" y="326" class="s">evidence · blockers · checkpoints</text><text x="24" y="458" class="s">Rule: agents record through the runner; the runner enforces who may do what.</text></svg>
